Transformations: names normalized to kebab-case, with the original names in
the registry; R factors rendered as labels with levels in metadata; R NA
rendered as the dedicated missing sentinel; penguins-raw Date Egg rendered as
an ISO 8601 string and its delta columns renamed delta-15-n and delta-13-c;
datasaurus-dozen kept in long form; titanic-passengers empty cabin and
embarked strings rendered as missing, test set omitted; nycflights13
time_hour rendered as an ISO 8601 UTC string, R doubles kept as reals; R
datasets objects reshaped as described in the catalog (time series with index
columns from R's time, calendar year and period except eu-stock-markets, whose year and
business-day follow R's nominal 260-day business year; tables and distance
matrices in long form; matrices with row-name columns; named vectors with a
name column; the state.* objects joined into one table). Source row order and
numeric precision retained. Source versions, archive and normalized SHA-256
hashes, variable descriptions, and dataset-specific notes are in the registry
(datasets/r-data/registry.rktd). Upstream documentation is retained in
datasets/r-data/provenance; full data license texts are in
datasets/r-data/licenses.
